---
/* Atlas — the EHR copilot. This is the flagship surface, so it gets the dark
   treatment and the most room.

   The hard problem Atlas actually solves is not "chat with the chart". It is
   that a real patient history is mostly UNSTRUCTURED and mostly SOMEONE ELSE'S:
   scanned faxes, outside discharge summaries, PDFs, handwriting. Answering a
   clinical question honestly means reading all of it, citing where each claim
   came from, and doing it without the record leaving the hospital's boundary.

   So the graphic shows three things in order: the question, an answer whose
   every clause is CITED back to a named source, and the documents themselves
   being read — including the ones nobody has structured. The boundary is a
   stated property on the surface, not a footnote. */
---

<div class="atl">
  <div class="atl__chrome" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="atl__dot"></span><span class="atl__dot"></span><span class="atl__dot"></span>
    <span class="atl__chrome-title">Atlas &middot; Reyes, Marisol &middot; 47</span>
    <span class="atl__boundary">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M8 1.8 13.2 4v4.1c0 3.2-2.2 5.3-5.2 6.1-3-.8-5.2-2.9-5.2-6.1V4L8 1.8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      Inside your tenant
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="atl__body">
    <p class="atl__ask">Has she presented with this before, and what was ruled out?</p>

    <div class="atl__answer">
      <p>
        Twice. <span class="atl__cite">March 2024<sup>1</sup></span> and
        <span class="atl__cite">November 2023<sup>2</sup></span>, both for chest
        tightness. ACS was ruled out on the second visit by serial troponins
        <span class="atl__cite">outside lab<sup>3</sup></span>. A stress echo was
        ordered and never completed.
      </p>
      <p class="atl__flag">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 1.6 15 14H1L8 1.6Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M8 6.2v3.4M8 11.4v.1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        The incomplete stress echo is the open thread from last time.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="atl__srcs-label">Read for this answer</p>
    <ul class="atl__srcs">
      <li>
        <span class="atl__ico atl__ico--fax" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M4 5.4V2.4h8v3M3 5.4h10a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 1.4 1.4v3.4A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 13 11.6h-1v2H4v-2H3a1.4 1.4 0 0 1-1.4-1.4V6.8A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 3 5.4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="atl__src-t"><b>Cardiology fax, scanned</b><i>14 pages &middot; handwritten margin notes</i></span>
        <span class="atl__badge">Read</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="atl__ico atl__ico--pdf" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M4 2h5l3.2 3.2V14H4V2Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M8.8 2.2v3.2H12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="atl__src-t"><b>Discharge summary, outside system</b><i>St. Vincent&rsquo;s &middot; not in your EHR</i></span>
        <span class="atl__badge">Read</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="atl__ico atl__ico--lab" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M6.4 2v4.3L2.8 12a1.6 1.6 0 0 0 1.4 2.4h7.6A1.6 1.6 0 0 0 13.2 12L9.6 6.3V2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M5.4 2h5.2M4.9 9.8h6.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="atl__src-t"><b>Serial troponins</b><i>Structured &middot; 3 results</i></span>
        <span class="atl__badge">Read</span>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="atl__foot">
      <span>Nothing here left the hospital. No training on your data.</span>
      <span class="atl__foot-n">Every read and write logged</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .atl {
    container-type: inline-size;
    inline-size: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--radius-6x);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(168deg, #0d211d 0%, #071417 58%, #05171e 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.10);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255 / 0.08),
      0 2px 6px rgb(from var(--neutral-100) r g b / 0.18),
      0 24px 56px rgb(from var(--neutral-100) r g b / 0.26);
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .atl__chrome {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.6cqw;
    padding: 3.2cqw 4cqw;
    border-block-end: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.09);
    background-color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.03);
  }
  .atl__dot { inline-size: 1.5cqw; block-size: 1.5cqw; border-radius: 100px; background-color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.20); }
  .atl__chrome-title { margin-inline-start: 2.4cqw; font-size: 2.7cqw; color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.62); }
  .atl__boundary {
    margin-inline-start: auto;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.4cqw;
    padding: 1.2cqw 2.6cqw;
    border-radius: 100px;
    border: 1px solid rgb(from var(--solace-30) r g b / 0.30);
    background-color: rgb(from var(--solace-30) r g b / 0.12);
    color: var(--solace-20);
    font-size: 2.6cqw;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .atl__boundary svg { inline-size: 3cqw; block-size: 3cqw; }

  .atl__body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3.4cqw; padding: 4.6cqw 4.6cqw 4cqw; }

  .atl__ask {
    align-self: flex-end;
    max-inline-size: 76%;
    padding: 2.6cqw 3.4cqw;
    border-radius: var(--radius-3x) var(--radius-3x) 0.8cqw var(--radius-3x);
    background-color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.10);
    font-size: 3.2cqw;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .atl__answer { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2.4cqw; }
  .atl__answer p { font-size: 3.3cqw; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.90); }

  /* Citations are inline and named. A claim you cannot trace is a claim a
     clinician cannot use. */
  .atl__cite {
    padding: 0.3cqw 1cqw;
    border-radius: 0.8cqw;
    background-color: rgb(from var(--solace-30) r g b / 0.18);
    color: var(--solace-20);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .atl__cite sup { font-size: 0.72em; margin-inline-start: 0.3cqw; opacity: 0.8; }

  .atl__flag {
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 2cqw;
    padding: 2.6cqw 3cqw;
    border-radius: var(--radius-2x);
    border-inline-start: 0.7cqw solid #c9a227;
    background-color: rgb(201 162 39 / 0.10);
    font-size: 3cqw !important;
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.88) !important;
  }
  .atl__flag svg { inline-size: 3.4cqw; block-size: 3.4cqw; flex: none; margin-block-start: 0.3cqw; color: #e8c04a; }

  .atl__srcs-label { font-size: 2.7cqw; color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.50); }

  .atl__srcs { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 1.8cqw; }
  .atl__srcs li {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2.6cqw;
    padding: 2.6cqw 3cqw;
    border-radius: var(--radius-2x);
    background-color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.07);
  }
  .atl__ico {
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    inline-size: 7cqw; block-size: 7cqw; flex: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-2x);
    background-color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.08);
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.80);
  }
  .atl__ico svg { inline-size: 3.8cqw; block-size: 3.8cqw; }
  .atl__ico--fax { color: #7fb8e8; }
  .atl__ico--pdf { color: #e8a07f; }
  .atl__ico--lab { color: var(--solace-30); }
  .atl__src-t { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.3cqw; min-inline-size: 0; }
  .atl__src-t b { font-size: 3cqw; font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); }
  .atl__src-t i { font-style: normal; font-size: 2.6cqw; color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.52); }
  .atl__badge {
    margin-inline-start: auto;
    padding: 0.9cqw 2.2cqw;
    border-radius: 100px;
    background-color: rgb(from var(--solace-30) r g b / 0.16);
    color: var(--solace-20);
    font-size: 2.5cqw;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .atl__foot {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 3cqw;
    margin-block-start: 1cqw;
    padding-block-start: 3cqw;
    border-block-start: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.09);
    font-size: 2.7cqw;
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.58);
  }
  .atl__foot-n { margin-inline-start: auto; color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.78); white-space: nowrap; }
</style>
